profile name. To disable either optimization in a profile patch:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Safety boundary"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Only the exact sentence used by DSH's standard/headless coding persona is relocated. A custom person"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"a that mentions `{{cwd}}` in another form is left unchanged because blindly moving arbitrary prose c"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"an change meaning. The plugin does not freeze tool catalogs, reuse stale context, proxy model respon"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"ses, or implement a second cache."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"DeepSeek's provider cache is automatic and depends on an exact prefix match from token zero. Storage"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" and eviction remain provider-controlled."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
